@@ -173,6 +173,7 @@ DM_NVN_UB_DEFER	switch	`0` ends the render pass at every inline uniform update,
 DM_NVN_UB_LAZY	switch	`=<n>`: the most deferred inline uniform updates kept across a render pass end (default 160); they land before the next copy, a conflicting draw or dispatch, or the submission end; `0` lands them at every pass end
