+# loadtruth-good-config — the state the user called "really really improved" (2026-11-17)
+
+**User's verdict on this configuration, verbatim:** "NOT perfect - there are still artifacts - but really
+really improved".  Not clean.  The measured residual in this configuration is in §4.
+
+This file exists so the state is reproducible from one commit id.  It is a *configuration* record plus the
+measured residual at the time of the commit; it is not a claim that the artifacts are fixed.
+
+## 1. The configuration (exactly the env of the reference run)
+
+```
+DM_FULLSCREEN=1
+DM_PRESENT_UPSCALE=metalfx        # present pass: MetalFX spatial scaler 1920x1080 -> 5120x2880
+DM_PRESENT_SNAP=4                 # present snapshot ring, 4 deep ("Frame buffering" = 4)
+DM_NVN_UI_REPUBLISH=0             # profile ui_republish 3 overridden OFF: this run does NOT include the republish
+DM_NVN_DRAWSTAT=<run>/drawstat.tsv:7200-14500/1
+DM_NVN_PIPE=7600-7660
+DM_WINDOW=0 DM_AUDIO=0 DM_MEM_CAP_GB=5 (runlane defaults, orch/sync-fix/runx.sh)
+```
+
