+## 4. The measured residual at the commit (DM_NVN_DRAWSTAT, 3,224 presents, frames 7202-14500)
+
+| class | presents | per 100 |
+|---|---|---|
+| glyph wall (`white>0.06 & nbrh>38`) | 1 | 0.03 |
+| vertex fan (`bsat>0.08`, non-wall) | 88 | 2.73 |
+| marginal (`nbrh>30 or white>0.03`) | 621 | 19.26 |
