+Run-lane agent, 2026-11-17 (afternoon). Branch `lego-hp57-artifact`; local commits only, nothing pushed.
+One `dmhost` at a time (`orch/repro/runlane.sh hold` inside the launcher, `pgrep -x dmhost` immediately before
