+## 1. The route, pinned — and the root cause of the Years 1–4 contamination
+
+The launcher (`nro2`, `libHarryLauncher`) puts its menu up at a **variable** frame (boot variance measured at
+~600 frames), and the default entry is **Years 1–4**:
+
+| run | DM_KEYS steps | first keys | module | load at |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| `offA` | 148 | `f1100:Right`, `f1600:A`, `f3000:A*26/110` | **nro0** | ~frame 2450 |
+| `off5k1` | 148 | same | **nro0** | — |
+| `on5k3` | 148 | same | **nro1** | ~frame 3050, right after `DM_KEYS: frame 3000.00 press 0x1` |
+| `offB` (147-step variant) | 147 | `f1100:Right`, **no A at 1600**, `f3800:A*26/110` | **nro1** ×2 attempts | ~3050 |
+| `menuprobe` | 1 | `f1100:Right` only | **nro0** | ~2450 |
+
+**Mechanism:** the `Right` press selects Years 5–7; if the menu is not up yet the press is swallowed and whatever
+confirms afterwards (the route's A burst, or the launcher's own auto-advance) takes the default, Years 1–4. The
+old recipe's `A` burst at frame 3000 sits inside the boot window on a slow boot — which is exactly when `on5k3`
+became Years 1–4.
+
+**The standardised recipe (150 steps — use this, nothing else):**
+
+```
+f1100:Right,f1600:A,f3000:Right,f3300:A,f3800:A*26/110,f5900:LUp+LRight~4.6*40/240,f6020:LUp+LLeft~4.6*40/240,f5960:A+LUp+LRight+RRight~0.12*20/480,f6080:A+LUp+LLeft+RLeft~0.12*20/480
+```
+
+The change from the 148-step recipe is one added `Right`+`A` pass at 3000/3300: it lands on the menu when the boot
+is slow (`Right` at 3000 → Years 5–7, `A` at 3300 confirms) and is an ordinary in-game Right+A when the boot is
+fast. Evidence it works where 148 failed: `runs/onD`, `runs/offC`, `runs/offD`, `runs/onE`, `runs/off2560`,
+`runs/off2560snap`, `runs/load2560`, `runs/clean3` all loaded **nro0** — including the slow-boot case
+(`runs/onD` `ro::LoadModule nro0` at log line 310, frame ~3050, the exact window where `on5k3` got nro1).
+
+Gates enforced in `orch/finalab/run.sh` (not by the caller): **module** (`nro0` required, `nro1` → kill + retry),
+**step count** (must be 150), **drawable** (`present geometry … 5120x2880`, no later `front end: drawable`).
