+## 9. Not established
+
+* Whether the 1.6–1.7 per 100 threshold-edge population in the 5K arm is visible to the user at all (it is not
+  the lattice class; its contrast is the clean scene's).
+* Whether the snapshot ring's effect is a *copy* effect or the extra frame of latency it adds — the two were not
+  separated (both are present at `DM_PRESENT_SNAP=4`).
+* Any headless artifact measurement: impossible in this tree as it stands (§6).
+* **Bit-identical save state across arms.** Each run wrote `HP2Slot0` at exit, so later arms may have started from
+  a slightly advanced save. The rates did not move across the sequence (OFF 1.70 then 1.60, ON 1.66 then 1.66),
+  so the effect is not visible in these numbers — but it is not zero by construction. The save has been restored.
